            meta_desc='What does a WCAG accessibility audit cost in 2026? Real price ranges: free automated scans, $1,800-$15,000 manual audits, remediation costs, and how small EU web agencies should scope and price accessibility work for clients.',
            badge_label='EAA &amp; PRICING',
            h1='What Does an Accessibility Audit Cost in 2026?<br>Real Numbers for Small Agencies',
            subtitle='Quotes range from $0 to $30,000 — and both can be legitimate. Here is what each price tier actually buys, what drives the cost, how to scope your own audits, and what to charge clients under the EAA.',
